{"product_id":"pick-up-sticks","title":"Pick up Sticks","description":"\u003cp\u003ePick up Sticks All she wanted was love. An unhappy childhood, a series of relationships that went nowhere, she devoted herself to her career. But her private life was empty. She was always looking for The One, the person who would love her and teach her to love in return. Was it too much to ask? Then one day she thought she had found him.. Pick Up Sticks is the true story of Sarah, a woman who thought she had met The One to take her to heaven - and found herself in the depravity of hell itself. She thought he was the love of her life. He thought he was the end of it. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:140 x 216  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: David Cullen \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781843752578 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 308\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43622628589721,"sku":"16RB-3-9781843752578","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/26c2c5b7bef7c00dabb1d384809430a6.jpg?v=1700911871","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/pick-up-sticks","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}